   "he": "וּפְטוּרִין מֵרְחִיצַת יָדַיִם. אָמַר אַבָּיֵי: לֹא שָׁנוּ אֶלָּא מַיִם רִאשׁוֹנִים, אֲבָל מַיִם אַחֲרוֹנִים חוֹבָה.",
   "en": "We learned in the mishna that in a military camp «one is exempt from» ritual «washing» of the «hands. Abaye said: They taught» this exemption «only» with regard to «first waters,» i.e., hand-washing before eating. «However, final waters,» i.e., hand-washing after eating and before reciting Grace after Meals, «is an obligation» even in a military camp."
  }
